# 行尾统一为 LF（仓库以 Windows 开发、需在 Linux/macOS 上可读）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：**必须显式声明**，否则 git 可能把 CRLF 归一化写进二进制文件
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.apk  binary
*.aar  binary
*.jar  binary
*.so   binary
*.dll  binary
*.exe  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.zst  binary
*.xlsx binary

# 生成物：不要在 diff / 语言统计里出现
*.keystore linguist-generated
*.apk      linguist-generated
*.jar      linguist-generated
